cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this evaluation harness or its published evidence, please cite it."
title: "vlm-eval-bench"
abstract: >-
  An auditable, config-driven harness for comparing local and API
  vision-language models on document understanding (DocVQA, ChartQA, CORD-v2),
  published together with a corrected offline rescore of a frozen 2026-07-10
  run. The published evidence is privacy-reduced and verifiable without GPU,
  dataset, or API access.
type: software
